  "description": "Basic Calculator (LeetCode 224) explained: one pass with a running total, a sign and a stack of (total, sign) per bracket; why brackets only flip signs, unary minus without special cases, recursion vs explicit stack, with a dry run and tested code.",
  "hero": {
