    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Expression parsing</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/basic-calculator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 224</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Basic Calculator</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">With only <code>+</code>, <code>-</code> and brackets, a bracket never changes the order of work, only the sign. Keep a running total, the current number and its sign; at <code>(</code> park <code>(total, sign)</code> on a stack and start fresh; at <code>)</code> fold the inner total back with the parked sign. One pass, O(n) time, O(depth) space.</p>\n"
  },
